## Integration
1. Mount the tape inside a container with position: relative and overflow: hidden so the rotated strip clips to the card.
2. Dim the card’s interactive content (about opacity 0.55) while the lock is active.
3. Render the tape markup only when the item is locked; keep it decorative with aria-hidden on the root.
4. Block selection and primary actions for the locked item in your own interaction layer.
5. Expose a screen-reader-only “Coming soon” (or equivalent) label outside the decorative tape root.

## Acceptance
- [ ] Tape is clipped by the card and reads at -28deg across the face
- [ ] Marquee loops with no visible seam
- [ ] Animation stops under reduced motion while the tape stays visible
- [ ] Lock state is announced by a screen reader without reading the tape copy
"
`;
